   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ICHR 2014 - 2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det till Independent Commission for Human Rights, ICHR, &#xe4;r ett k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till den palestinska myndighetens ombudsmanna institution f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter. St&#xf6;det syftar till att st&#xf6;dja ICHR i sitt uppdrag av att f&#xf6;lja utvecklingen f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter i de ockuperade palestinska omr&#xe5;dena, samt arbeta med ansvarsutkr&#xe4;vande av myndigheter, ge kapacitetsst&#xf6;d samt arbeta med opinionsbildning f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Independent Commission for Human Rights, ICHR, is a core support to the Palestinian Authority&apos;s ombudsman for human rights. The intervention aims at supporting the ICHR in its mission to monitor the development of human rights in the occupied Palestinian territories, as well as work with the accountability of authorities, providing capacity support and work with advocacy for human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
